  "notes": [
    "Latest results are reconciled by environment, project and test title; targeted reruns replace superseded failures.",
    "The initial fractional mount assertion compared DIP edges without physical-pixel snapping; its four cases passed after correcting the assertion.",
    "The Gallery inventory now loads each route independently, checks a real SDK canvas and selects actual Expander hosts. Source scrolling waits for the async presenter after each theme change.",
